 is free. However, some <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-free-seo-tools\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO tools<\/a> also allow you to search for LSI keywords.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Let&#8217;s look at some of the best tools to find LSI keywords:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Google Autocomplete<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"632\" height=\"668\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/google-autocomplete.webp\" alt=\"Google Autocomplete\" class=\"wp-image-7909\" style=\"width:278px;height:294px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/google-autocomplete.webp 632w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/google-autocomplete-284x300.webp 284w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/google-autocomplete-150x159.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 632px) 100vw, 632px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Google\u2019s instant search feature is a straightforward way to find keywords related to your main one. Type the target keyword into Google\u2019s search box, and you will get multiple predictions about what you might type next.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Examine for the words that appear in bold as suggestions. Make a list of relevant ones to your topic and incorporate them into your content.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Google&#8217;s Related Searches<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Google shares a list of LSI keywords on its search engine results pages (SERP). Whenever you perform a Google search for something and scroll down to the bottom of the SERPs, you see a section called Related Searches. This section contains multiple keywords related to your search query. You can incorporate these keywords as well to diversify your content.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. LSI Graph<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"456\" height=\"88\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/lsi-graph.webp\" alt=\"LSI Graph\" class=\"wp-image-7910\" style=\"width:245px;height:47px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/lsi-graph.webp 456w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/lsi-graph-300x58.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/lsi-graph-150x29.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 456px) 100vw, 456px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>This online tool helps you navigate through the LSI keywords. Enter your seed keyword and watch a map of related keywords unfold. Explore the interconnected web of phrases, identify high-value keywords, and enrich your content with relevant LSI magic.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Google Search Console (GSC)<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"585\" height=\"368\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/google-search-console.webp\" alt=\"Google Search Console\" class=\"wp-image-6256\" style=\"width:223px;height:140px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/google-search-console.webp 585w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/google-search-console-300x189.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 585px) 100vw, 585px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Peek into Google&#8217;s mind with <a href=\"https:\/\/search.google.com\/search-console\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">GSC&#8217;s<\/a> &#8220;Search Analytics&#8221; report. Analyze the Queries section for terms users searched to find your content. These are goldmines for relevant LSI keywords, often long-tail phrases indicating specific search intent.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. Answer The Public<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"917\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/answerthepublic-tool-for-seo-interview-questions-1-1024x917.jpg\" alt=\"answerthepublic tool for seo\" class=\"wp-image-2466\" style=\"width:231px;height:206px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/answerthepublic-tool-for-seo-interview-questions-1-1024x917.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/answerthepublic-tool-for-seo-interview-questions-1-300x269.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/answerthepublic-tool-for-seo-interview-questions-1-768x688.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/answerthepublic-tool-for-seo-interview-questions-1-1536x1376.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/answerthepublic-tool-for-seo-interview-questions-1.jpg 1710w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/answerthepublic.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Answer The Public<\/a> unveils popular search questions related to your seed keyword. Analyze the questions, delve into the People Also Ask section, and reveal a variety of LSI keywords based on actual user queries.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>6. SEMrush<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/semrush-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"semrush\" class=\"wp-image-7317\" style=\"width:231px;height:129px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/sem